+## Checking against your budget
+
+The `budget` command shows how your spending in a given month compares to the
+category limits you have configured:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+For each category that has a configured budget, it prints the amount spent and
+the limit, so you can see at a glance where you are over, under, or on track.
+Categories with no configured budget are omitted from the output.
+
